---
description: Ensure proposed brand directions differ in strategy rather than cosmetic wording.
args:{brief:ProductBrief;directions:BrandDirection[];constraints:{supportedClaimIds:string[];blockedClaims:string[];requiredDisclosures:string[];rightsQuestions:string[];}}
returns:BrandDirection[]
---
For each direction preserve its audience, message logic, emphasis, exclusions, and supported claim links. Compare pairwise for real strategic difference. Reject or revise directions that merely swap slogans or that rely on blocked promises. Keep open rights questions attached to the exact direction name or asset.
